# BUT sop-evolver skill source files are part of the source repo (committed)
# Important: .agents/skills must be a REAL directory (not symlink to ../skills),
# otherwise sop-evolver skill 5 files would create infinite symlink loops.
!.agents/skills/
!.agents/skills/sop-evolver/
